ing the regression could\n35\tleave no residue in the tree being closed:\n36\t- `test_two_logs_at_one_key_declaring_two_phases_serve_no_round` — relaxing the\n37\t  `len(ph) == 1` ambiguity rule (`:608`) to last-wins fails exactly this test and\n38\t  nothing else (`1 failed, 52 passed`).\n39\t- `test_an_attestation_riding_a_commit_that_changed_the_work_is_not_read` —\n40\t  deleting the `governing_identity(...) != tree` carrier guard (`:802-803`) fails\n41\t  exactly this test and nothing else (`1 failed, 52 passed`).\n42\tBoth previously left `134 passed` across the three modules the return measured.\n43\tEach fixture asserts its own premises (both logs really committed, the round file\n44\tstill present; the forged carrier really moved the governing identity) so the\n45\tempty answer is the RULE and not an empty scan.\n46\t\n47\tTHE TWO `TC-205` CELLS. `evidence` now reaches `work_tip` /\n48\t`refresh_attestation`'s refusal arms by citing the five\n49\t`tests/test_integrate_station.py` tests that hold them — all five verified to\n50\texist — with a `Method` sentence saying which arms those are and why the station\n51\tsuite is where they live. `method`'s identity sentence was made true BY THE\n52\tFIXTURE rather than by weakening the sentence: the changed `docs/work/` spec blob\n53\tnow really folds DIFFERENT, the pre-existing dropped-entry assertion left beside\n54\tit as the weaker claim.\n55\t\n56\t`CMP-006`'s note re-points to name BOTH modules not owned there — `station.py`\n57\t(LLR-182, IF-093) and `verdict.py` (LLR-207, IF-175) — the sentence THIS row\n58\tfalsified by giving `verdict.py` a CMP-008 tag. Re-derived at close by the\n59\tcomplementary route (enumerating rows by `Module` path, not by component, checked\n60\tagainst the directory listing): all eleven `kitlib/` modules are claimed by an\n61\tLLR row, and exactly two sit at CMP-008.\n62\t\n63\tSPOTTED, NOT FIXED — the same cell's parenthetical enumerating kitlib's CMP-006\n64\tmembers omits `evi